| Step                                 | Command (Copy & Paste)                                                                                                                       | What It Does                                                                                                                                                 |
| ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **1. Update Debian**                 | `bash sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade -y `                                                                                               | Updates all installed packages.                                                                                                                              |
| **2. Install Firejail**              | `bash sudo apt install firejail firejail-profiles -y `                                                                                       | Installs the sandbox you'll use to isolate Tor Browser.                                                                                                      |
| **3. Download Tor Browser**          | `bash mkdir -p ~/Downloads && cd ~/Downloads wget https://www.torproject.org/dist/torbrowser/14.5.7/tor-browser-linux-x86_64-14.5.7.tar.xz ` | Downloads the Tor Browser. *(Replace the version number with the latest release when necessary.)*                                                            |
| **4. Extract Tor Browser**           | `bash tar -xf tor-browser-linux-x86_64-*.tar.xz `                                                                                            | Extracts the browser files.                                                                                                                                  |
| **5. Move Tor Browser**              | `bash mv tor-browser ~/Applications/ `                                                                                                       | Places Tor Browser in a permanent location.                                                                                                                  |
| **6. Start Tor Browser (Sandboxed)** | `bash firejail --profile=/etc/firejail/tor-browser.profile ~/Applications/tor-browser/start-tor-browser.desktop `                            | Starts Tor Browser inside Firejail. If your system doesn't include this profile, `firejail ~/Applications/tor-browser/start-tor-browser.desktop` also works. |
| **7. Verify Firejail Is Running**    | `bash firejail --list `                                                                                                                      | Shows all applications currently sandboxed by Firejail.                                                                                                      |
| **8. Verify the Sandbox**            | `bash firejail --tree `                                                                                                                      | Displays the process tree of sandboxed applications.                                                                                                         |
| **9. Verify Tor Connection**         | Open Tor Browser → Visit **[https://check.torproject.org](https://check.torproject.org)**                                                    | Confirms you are using the Tor network.                                                                                                                      |
| **10. Close Tor Browser**            | Close the browser normally.                                                                                                                  | Ends the Tor session and the Firejail sandbox.                                                                                                               |
